; n80 test: scanner M80 compatibility
;   Tests that punctuation (/, !, etc.) terminates opcode token scanning
;   even when the directive is at column 1 (no leading space).

        .8080

; 1. Classic form: space between directive and delimiter
        .PRINTX /TESTE 1: COM ESPACO - OK/

; 2. Critical: no space before slash (column 1)
.PRINTX/TESTE 2: SEM ESPACO COM BARRA - OK/

; 3. No space before exclamation (column 1)
.PRINTX!TESTE 3: SEM ESPACO COM EXCLAMACAO - OK!

; 4. RET followed immediately by comment (semicolon stripped before scan)
        RET;FIM DA SUBROTINA

; 5. Regression: octal and Intel hex still work
        CPI     12Q
        ANI     X'7F'

        END
